    {
      "type": "h2",
      "text": "Dr. Paul J. Kim"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Paul J. Kim, DDS, MS is a board-certified orthodontist dedicated to creating healthy, confident smiles for patients of all ages. He earned his Bachelor of Arts in Chemistry and Chemical Biology from Cornell University before receiving his Doctor of Dental Surgery (DDS) degree from the UCLA School of Dentistry. Dr. Kim then completed his Master of Science in Orthodontics and a one-year orthodontic internship at The Ohio State University College of Dentistry. With over four years of private practice experience, he provides comprehensive orthodontic care, including traditional braces, Invisalign® and Spark™ clear aligner therapy, Phase I treatment, and temporary anchorage devices (TADs). As an American Board of Orthodontics (ABO) Diplomate, Dr. Kim is committed to providing exceptional, evidence-based orthodontic care with a personalized approach. Outside the office, he enjoys connecting with patients and helping them achieve confident, healthy smiles. His warm personality, attention to detail, and passion for orthodontics make him a wonderful addition to the team."
    },
    {
      "type": "img",
