    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "DUBLIN & TRACY CALIFORNIA (CA), FOR BRACES & INVISALIGN"
    },
    {
      "type": "p",
      "text": "Dr. Gonzales and his staff are truly outstanding. They have an excellent manner with children, while being extremely competent and professional. I would feel comfortable recommending their services to anyone."
    },
